For me the distinction is that a quest artifact is meant specifically
for that character class. The fact that only Tourists can perform
blessed charging with the PYEC illustrates this intention, in my
opinion. Now, rather than similarly crippling other quest artifacts
for members not of the intended class (not sure how this would even
work with the Eye or the Orb of Fate, probably the most desired quest
artifacts from my reading others' ascension posts), I'm suggesting
making it an optional conduct to get by without them.

